WEBVTT

00:04:29.434 --> 00:04:34.000
Darvin o’z tadqiqotida Fransuz 
nevrologi Giyom Dushenning yuziga

00:04:34.024 --> 00:04:39.380
tabassum yugurtirish va faollashtirish 
uchun elektr shoklarni yuborgan.

00:04:39.404 --> 00:04:41.308
Iltimos, buni uyda o’zingizda sinamang.

00:04:41.332 --> 00:04:42.976
(Kulgu)

00:04:43.586 --> 00:04:45.285
Shunga aloqador nemis tadqiqotida,

00:04:45.309 --> 00:04:48.976
tadqiqotchilar yuzning jilmayishga 
javobgar mushaklarini falaj qilish uchun

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:54.436
botoksdan oldin va undan so’ng miya 
faoliyatini o’lchashda MRTdan foydalandi.

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:57.286
Natijalar Darvinning nazariyasini 
tasdiqladi,

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:59.183
yuzdagi qayta aloqa jilmayganimizda

00:04:59.207 --> 00:05:02.976
miyadagi hissiyotlar holatini
neyronlar aloqasini yaxshilash orqali